.com/users/thomfilg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomfilg/thommf-portfolio/commits/f03fa5d1d4ef03b6a341dfb2709efd193634f4aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-26T09:59:14Z","email":"tigredonorte3@gmail.com","name":"Thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-04T12:02:43Z","email":"tigredonorte3@gmail.com","name":"Thompson"},"message":"refactor(infra): restructure Terraform to modular architecture\n\n- Decompose monolithic infrastructure into reusable modules (CloudFront, IAM, Route53, S3)\n- Implement environment-specific backend configuration (dev/staging/prod)\n- Modernize GitHub Actions deployment workflows with improved error handling\n- Add Terraform linting configuration and code quality tools\n- Remove deprecated backend files and unused configuration\n- Enhance variable organization and module documentation\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Infrastructure deployment now requires environment-specific backend configuration files. Existing deployments must migrate to new module structure.","tree":{"sha":"b00bfd9bb54d0d2f54478e90054298e44bd02313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomfilg/thommf-portfolio/git/trees/b00bfd9bb54d0d2f54478e90054298e44bd02313"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thomfilg/thommf-portfolio/git/commits/f03fa5d1d4ef03b6a341dfb2709efd193634f4aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/648890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomfilg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomfilg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomfilg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomfilg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thomfilg","id":648890,"login":"thomfilg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODg5MA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thomfil