name":"Franck Nouama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-15T20:19:00Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"message":"fix: resolve Kitchen Service domain model ID collisions and repository test failures\n\n**Domain Model Fixes:**\n- Replace timestamp-based ID generation with nanosecond + atomic counter approach\n- Fix KitchenOrder ID generation to use `ko_{nanoseconds}_{counter}` format\n- Fix KitchenItem ID generation to use `ki_{nanoseconds}_{counter}` format\n- Add atomic counters to ensure truly unique IDs even in high-concurrency scenarios\n\n**Repository Test Fixes:**\n- Resolve UNIQUE constraint failures that were causing test data corruption\n- Fix TestList_WithDateFilters that was failing due to missing orders in database\n- Ensure all repository tests pass consistently without flakiness\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe timestamp-based ID generation (`time.Now().Format()`) was creating duplicate IDs when\nmultiple domain objects were created within the same microsecond during testing, causing:\n- Database UNIQUE constraint violations\n- Silent save failures in repository tests\n- Inconsistent test results depending on execution order\n\n**Solution:**\nImplement atomic counter + nanosecond timestamp combination to guarantee unique IDs\nacross all domain entities in high-frequency creation scenarios.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a951ef941518d585923764d9fc09ae767fac7296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/a951ef941518d585923764d9fc09ae767fac7296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/3faf199b8eaed7cff9270c0e269b9ddba5d3b68d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franck