tion\n\n## Backend Improvements\n\n### Inventory Service\n- Implement all stub repository methods for stock movements and suppliers\n- Add comprehensive database schema migration (002_fix_inventory_schema.sql)\n- Complete CRUD operations for suppliers with full field support\n- Add helper methods for querying movements by item and date range\n- Fix service layer to match new supplier creation signature\n- Add comprehensive integration tests for repository and handlers\n\n### Kitchen Service\n- Implement all missing event publishing for status changes:\n  - KitchenItemStatusChangedEvent for UpdateItemStatus\n  - KitchenOrderAssignedEvent for AssignToStation\n  - KitchenOrderPriorityChangedEvent for SetPriority\n  - KitchenOrderCancelledEvent for CancelKitchenOrder\n  - KitchenOrderCompletedEvent for CompleteKitchenOrder\n- Fix all related tests with proper mock event publisher expectations\n\n### Shared Events\n- Add missing event types: StockWastedEvent, StockReturnedEvent, SupplierDeletedEvent\n- Add SupplierDeletedData type for type-safe event publishing\n\n## Frontend Integration\n\n### Inventory MFE Complete API Integration\n- Create comprehensive API service layer (inventoryService.ts)\n- Implement Zustand stores for inventory, suppliers, and alerts\n- Replace all mock data with real API calls in:\n  - InventoryDashboard: Live metrics, alerts, and activity\n  - InventoryManagement: Full CRUD with filtering and pagination\n  - StockManagement: Real stock operations and movements\n- Add proper error handling and loading states\n- Maintain type safety throughout the integration\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17f177d3b3fee1b5980dafba4c7158ccb772c2ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/17f177d3b3fee1b5980dafba4c7158ccb772c2ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/47469f2d041d35c40fee4249