raceful fallback behaviors\n- Responsive design across mobile, tablet, desktop\n- Accessibility features (keyboard nav, screen readers, ARIA)\n- Performance optimization and memory management\n- Real-time data updates and network resilience\n\n## Configuration Updates:\n- Updated Jest config to use jsdom environment for React testing\n- Enhanced mock setup for shared packages integration\n- Coverage thresholds set to 80% for comprehensive quality assurance\n\n## Test Quality Features:\n- Realistic test scenarios with proper mocking\n- Event data validation and error handling\n- User interaction testing (clicks, forms, navigation)\n- Integration testing for cross-component communication\n- Performance and optimization verification\n\nCloses #6\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6662b181c37dc95148c2b857e9a347716be76627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/6662b181c37dc95148c2b857e9a347716be76627"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/68ddd07cb51b0745d510f47892917e242eb7e9a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_adm