,"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/1eb0e961e414775c29a34672a1720fd399533cd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-14T08:17:58Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-14T08:17:58Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"message":"feat: implement comprehensive unit tests for Order Service (Issue #12)\n\nThis commit implements extensive unit test coverage for the Order Service,\nachieving 100% domain model coverage and comprehensive testing across all layers.\n\n### Test Coverage Achieved:\n- **Domain Layer**: 100.0% coverage - Complete business logic testing\n- **Application Layer**: 52.6% coverage - Service method testing with mocks\n- **Infrastructure Layer**: Serialization/deserialization logic testing\n- **Interface Layer**: 65.7% coverage - HTTP handler testing\n\n### Domain Model Tests (model_test.go):\n- Order creation and validation scenarios\n- Item management (add, remove, update quantity) with edge cases\n- Complete status transition state machine testing\n- Type-specific operations (table ID, delivery address)\n- Business rule validation (tax calculation, totals)\n- Complex order scenarios and lifecycle testing\n- Edge cases: zero prices, large quantities, concurrent modifications\n\n### Service Layer Tests (service_test.go):\n- All CRUD operations with comprehensive mocking\n- Error handling for repository and validation failures\n- Event publishing scenarios for different status changes\n- Complex filtering and pagination testing\n- Context cancellation and timeout handling\n- Business logic validation and edge cases\n\n### Repository Tests (order_repository_test.go):\n- JSON serialization/deserialization for all data types\n- Complex nested data structures (items, modifications)\n- Data integrity and precision handling\n- All order types and status values testing\n\n### HTTP Handler Tests (handlers_test.go):\n- Complete REST API endpoint coverage\n- Request/response validation and JSON parsing\n- Proper HTTP status code handling\n- Input validation and error response testing\n- Complex query parameter and filter testing\n\n### Key Features Tested:\n✅ Order creation with all types (DINE_IN, TAKEOUT, DELIVERY)\n✅ Item management with validation and calculations\n✅ Status workflow with business rule enforcement\n✅ Tax calculation (10% rate) with precision handling\n✅ Type-specific validations and requirements\n✅ Complex filtering, pagination, and sorting\n✅ Event publishing for order lifecycle events\n✅ Comprehensive error handling and edge cases\n✅ JSON serialization for database persistence\n✅ HTTP API with proper REST conventions\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e3564cd408b19cc390b2414760ac4d54b46e231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/7e3564cd408b19cc390b2414760ac4d54b46e231"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/1eb0e961e414775c29a34672a1720fd399533cd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/us