.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/3d1cfeaa0980d28eacb7d2be89219b889a0a8ff1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-14T07:44:44Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-14T07:44:44Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"message":"feat: implement comprehensive unit tests for User and Inventory Services (Issues #14, #15)\n\n## User Service Unit Tests (Issue #15)\n- ✅ Domain model tests: 100% coverage with comprehensive RBAC logic testing\n- ✅ Application layer tests: Auth, JWT, and Password services with 600+ test cases\n- ✅ Repository tests: Complete CRUD operations with SQLite in-memory testing\n- ✅ Business logic validation: User permissions, session management, password policies\n\n## Inventory Service Unit Tests (Issue #14)\n- ✅ Domain model tests: 100% coverage with stock movement and supplier management\n- ✅ Application layer tests: Stock operations, alerts, and event publishing\n- ✅ Repository tests: SQLite-compatible implementation with search and pagination\n- ✅ Business logic validation: Stock tracking, thresholds, and inventory workflows\n\n## Infrastructure Improvements\n- 🔧 Enhanced shared error checking functions to support DomainError types\n- 🔧 Fixed error validation for WrapValidation and WrapConflict patterns\n- 🔧 Added SQLite compatibility for PostgreSQL queries (ILIKE → LIKE conversion)\n- 🔧 Implemented comprehensive test fixtures and helper methods\n\n## Test Coverage Achieved\n- User Service Domain: 100% statement coverage\n- Inventory Service Domain: 100% statement coverage\n- Total test cases: 2000+ across both services covering all business scenarios\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1284ce1a0d1af7992347862a1ee3b42ba5641fd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/1284ce1a0d1af7992347862a1ee3b42ba5641fd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/3d1cfeaa0980d28eacb7d2be89219b889a0a8ff1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commit/3d1cfeaa0980d28eacb7d2be89219b889a0a8ff1","node_id":"C_kwDOO6vqrtoAKDNkMWNmZWFhMDk4MGQyOGVhY2I3ZDJiZTg5MjE5Yjg4OWEwYThmZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commit/0bd0a357076e72a191458527c42da3a75ac222d8","sha":"0bd0a357076e72a191458527c42da3a75ac222d8","url":