\n\n- Add application service tests (63.7% coverage)\n  * Service layer with mocked dependencies\n  * Event publishing integration\n  * Error handling and validation\n  * Complete reservation workflows\n\n- Add repository tests (78.9% coverage)\n  * SQLite in-memory database for testing\n  * CRUD operations with proper SQLite compatibility\n  * Complex queries (date ranges, customer filtering, table availability)\n  * Transaction handling and data integrity\n\n- Fix repository implementation\n  * Convert PostgreSQL placeholders to SQLite format (? instead of $1, $2)\n  * Fix Update method parameter ordering\n  * Improve table availability query logic\n  * Fix time overlap calculations for reservations\n\n- Add test dependencies\n  * testify framework for assertions and test suites\n  * go-sqlite3 for in-memory database testing\n\n- Enhance shared ID generation\n  * Add microsecond precision to prevent ID collisions\n  * Improve uniqueness for high-frequency operations\n\nTotal coverage: 51.7% overall with excellent coverage in critical layers\n- Domain: 100% (business logic fully tested)\n- Infrastructure: 78.9% (database operations well tested)\n- Application: 63.7% (service logic well tested)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86fc6a9e08cf27b4878734834fd4fbf0d6a886cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/86fc6a9e08cf27b4878734834fd4fbf0d6a886cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/0bd0a357076e72a191458527c42da3a75ac222d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/