.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/a4634eed2d464573489f017c648ab327db57fee5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-14T03:40:54Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-14T03:40:54Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"message":"feat: implement comprehensive unit tests for Kitchen Service\n\nThis commit implements complete unit test coverage for the Kitchen Service backend,\nmatching the comprehensive testing patterns established in the Menu and Order services.\n\n### Test Coverage Added:\n- **Domain Model Tests** (826 lines): Complete business logic validation including\n  kitchen order lifecycle, item status transitions, automatic status updates, time\n  calculations, and validation rules\n- **Application Service Tests** (867 lines): Full service layer testing with mocking\n  for repository and event publisher interactions, error handling, and complex workflows\n- **Repository Tests** (622 lines): Data persistence layer testing with SQLite in-memory\n  database, CRUD operations, filtering, pagination, and serialization\n\n### Key Features Tested:\n- Kitchen order creation and lifecycle management (NEW → PREPARING → READY → COMPLETED)\n- Kitchen item status transitions and automatic order status updates\n- Priority management with proper sorting (URGENT > HIGH > NORMAL > LOW)\n- Station assignment and workflow management\n- Time tracking (estimated time, elapsed time, remaining time)\n- Complex filtering and pagination with date ranges\n- Comprehensive error handling and validation\n- Event publishing integration\n\n### Technical Improvements:\n- Fixed domain model automatic status update logic for order completion\n- Enhanced SQLite compatibility with proper query placeholders and time handling\n- Improved priority sorting with CASE statements for consistent ordering\n- Added comprehensive test data setup with valid state transitions\n- Implemented proper test isolation and cleanup\n\nCloses #11\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"799bf53882bdf90d4d14ff116953e13c161c7497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/799bf53882bdf90d4d14ff116953e13c161c7497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/a4634eed2d464573489f017c648ab327db57fee5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u