795289926584529cc737cddf2e76507d0218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/8a70795289926584529cc737cddf2e76507d0218"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/a6cdc7b05e5a16bf110123ffd80f4f9588f3aaeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-13T16:18:59Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-13T16:18:59Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"message":"feat: implement complete Kitchen MFE with comprehensive operations management\n\n## Kitchen MFE Implementation (Phase 4 Complete)\n\n### Core Application Structure\n- Created kitchen-mfe on port 3003 with Module Federation configuration\n- Configured Webpack with TailwindCSS and kitchen-specific styling\n- Set up TypeScript configuration and project structure\n- Integrated with shared packages for consistent UI and state management\n\n### Kitchen Views (6 Complete Views)\n- **KitchenQueuePage**: Main operations dashboard with active orders, priority management, station filtering, and real-time updates\n- **OrderPreparationPage**: Detailed order preparation with step-by-step instructions, timers, and progress tracking\n- **StationManagementPage**: Kitchen station overview with chef assignments, capacity monitoring, and workload distribution\n- **KitchenAnalyticsPage**: Performance metrics with station analytics, chef performance, and operational insights\n- **TimerManagementPage**: Advanced timer system with presets, multiple timer tracking, and cooking stage management\n- **RecipeBoardPage**: Recipe management with detailed instructions, ingredients, allergens, and cooking guidelines\n\n### Advanced Kitchen Features\n- Event-driven architecture with restaurant event bus integration\n- Real-time order processing from orders-mfe to kitchen queue\n- Kitchen-specific animations for urgent orders and timer displays\n- Multi-station workflow (grill, prep, salad, dessert, drinks)\n- Priority management system with visual indicators\n- Built-in performance monitoring and analytics\n\n### Technical Implementation\n- Module Federation exposes: Kitchen, KitchenRoutes, KitchenComponents, KitchenServices, KitchenStore\n- Custom TailwindCSS configuration with kitchen-specific colors and animations\n- TypeScript support with proper type definitions\n- Responsive design with grid layouts for different screen sizes\n- Error boundaries for MFE isolation\n- Professional loading states and transitions\n\n### Integration\n- Fully integrated with shell-app routing and navigation\n- RBAC integration using PermissionResources.KITCHEN\n- Cross-MFE communication via shared event bus\n- Consistent styling with restaurant platform design system\n\nThe Kitchen MFE provides production-ready kitchen operations management with comprehensive workflow support for restaurant kitchen staff.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c0aa9d1068c748eb6dc0909f81a3ed692148490","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/7c0aa9d1068c748eb6dc0909f81a3ed692148490"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/a6cdc7b05e5a16bf110123ffd80f4f9588f3aaeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commit/a6cdc7b05e5a16bf110123ffd80f4f9588f3aaeb","node_id":"C_kwDOO6vqrtoAKGE2Y2RjN2IwNWU1YTE2YmYxMTAxMjNmZmQ4MGY0Zjk1ODhmM2FhZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commit/6b57c58af34b2b58b63372f7fbdecac75bd1ce78","sha":"6b57c58af34b2b58b63372f7fbdecac75bd1ce78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/6b57c58af34b2b58b63372f7fbdecac75bd1ce78"}],"sha":"a6cdc7b05e5a16bf110123ffd80f4f9588f3aaeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos