tchen communications\n- React hooks for easy event handling across MFEs\n- Event history and debugging capabilities\n\n## Order-Menu Integration\n- Real-time menu item availability updates in order creation\n- Cross-MFE communication when orders are created\n- Event-driven architecture for seamless data synchronization\n- Order creation triggers events to kitchen and other MFEs\n\n## Technical Features\n- Module Federation configuration for orders MFE (port 3002)\n- TypeScript event types for type-safe cross-MFE communication\n- Comprehensive order management workflows\n- Customer profile management with order history\n- Payment processing with multiple payment methods\n- Responsive design with TailwindCSS styling\n\nThis establishes the foundation for real-time communication between\nMenu and Orders MFEs, with extensible patterns for Kitchen integration.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"242607b20b3c7583b9d5aca3b934241380175c8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/242607b20b3c7583b9d5aca3b934241380175c8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/6b57c58af34b2b58b63372f7fbdecac75bd1ce78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.git