uama/restaurant-platform/commits/7426445f3e8b64003779e7b6a8d205a46dc0ecef"}],"sha":"84390228cb4a35e8e0f7edc30093a2930cbd2546","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/84390228cb4a35e8e0f7edc30093a2930cbd2546"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/586511?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/francknouama","id":586511,"login":"francknouama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjUxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francknouama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/commits/7426445f3e8b64003779e7b6a8d205a46dc0ecef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-13T00:28:30Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-13T00:28:30Z","email":"franck.nouama@gmail.com","name":"Franck Nouama"},"message":"Implement Phase 3: Complete Kitchen & Reservation Management Systems\n\n## Major Features Added\n\n### Kitchen Management System\n- Real-time kitchen dashboard with auto-refresh (15s intervals)\n- Complete kitchen workflow: NEW → PREPARING → READY → COMPLETED\n- Station assignment and management\n- Priority management (LOW, NORMAL, HIGH, URGENT)\n- Individual item tracking within orders\n- Overdue order alerts and progress tracking\n- Kitchen metrics and performance analytics\n\n### Reservation Management System\n- Complete reservation lifecycle: PENDING → CONFIRMED → CHECKED_IN → COMPLETED\n- Real-time reservation dashboard with auto-refresh (30s intervals)\n- Advanced filtering (status, date, party size, table)\n- Waitlist management with customer notifications\n- Table availability checking\n- No-show tracking and management\n- Business rule validation throughout\n\n### API Integration Layer\n- Complete React Query hooks for all operations\n- Kitchen API service with real-time capabilities\n- Reservation API service with comprehensive CRUD\n- Optimistic updates for immediate UI feedback\n- Error handling with graceful degradation\n- Cache invalidation strategies\n\n### Restaurant UI Components\n- Professional restaurant-themed design system\n- Status-aware color coding throughout\n- Touch-friendly interfaces for tablet use\n- Real-time indicators and alerts\n- Responsive layouts for all screen sizes\n\n### Technical Improvements\n- Type-safe domain models matching Go backend\n- Business rule validation at compile time\n- Real-time auto-refresh patterns\n- Comprehensive error boundaries\n- Professional loading states\n\n## Architecture Enhancements\n- Domain-driven component organization\n- Clean separation of concerns\n- Restaurant-specific business logic\n- Cross-domain operational integration ready\n- WebSocket foundation prepared\n\nRestaurant platform now includes complete kitchen workflow management\nand reservation system with real-time updates and professional UX.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71df6d29749cc7668e7287475c796b34c64fbd9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/trees/71df6d29749cc7668e7287475c796b34c64fbd9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/francknouama/restaurant-platform/git/commits/7426445f3e8b6